WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.000
Yes, they come here to threaten us.

2
00:00:07.453 --> 00:00:13.905
Then some houses get knocked down,
but not all of them.

3
00:00:14.696 --> 00:00:17.450
People were already desperate.

4
00:00:19.657 --> 00:00:24.729
People with families: when the house
comes down, where are they supposed to go?

5
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.365
There's nowhere to go.
If at least they gave people houses,

6
00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.206
even if they had to pay rent,
people would go.

7
00:00:33.396 --> 00:00:37.807
But without a house, what are people
supposed to do? Stay on the street?

8
00:00:38.137 --> 00:00:39.868
Live on the street with family?

9
00:00:42.198 --> 00:00:46.509
It was already sad, it was really hard.

10
00:00:47.439 --> 00:00:52.050
Are you afraid this might happen?
I'm afraid, yes. I'm afraid.

11
00:00:52.555 --> 00:00:57.308
And on the days they come here
to tear the houses down,

12
00:00:57.439 --> 00:01:01.011
I don't go to work,
because the fear is so great...

13
00:01:01.421 --> 00:01:07.110
Lying awake, because I don't
know what day they'll tear it down.

14
00:01:07.746 --> 00:01:13.420
I don't have a day,
I don't have a home. Yes, that's it.
